            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure relates to a novel heterocyclic amine derivative represented by the following Chemical Formula 1 and a pharmaceutical composition comprising the same, and the compound according to the present disclosure can be usefully used for the prevention or treatment of autoimmune diseases or cancers.wherein, in Chemical Formula 1, R&amp;lt;sub&amp;gt;1&amp;lt;/sub&amp;gt;, R&amp;lt;sub&amp;gt;2&amp;lt;/sub&amp;gt;, X&amp;lt;sub&amp;gt;1&amp;lt;/sub&amp;gt;, X&amp;lt;sub&amp;gt;2&amp;lt;/sub&amp;gt;, L, Y, A and B are the same as defined in the specification.</p>
